        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>The <span class=\"math\">[MATH: n]</span>th-degree Taylor polynomial of a function <span class=\"math\">[MATH: f(x)]</span> around the point <span class=\"math\">[MATH: x=a]</span> is</p>",
            "readable_text": "The [MATH: n]th-degree Taylor polynomial of a function [MATH: f(x)] around the point [MATH: x=a] is",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: P_n(x) = f(a) + f&#x27;(a)(x-a) + \\dfrac{f&#x27;&#x27;(a)}{2!}(x-a)^2 + \\cdots + \\dfrac{f^{(n)}(a)}{n!}(x-a)^n.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "[MATH: P_n(x) = f(a) + f'(a)(x-a) + \\dfrac{f''(a)}{2!}(x-a)^2 + \\cdots + \\dfrac{f^{(n)}(a)}{n!}(x-a)^n.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>In particular, the coefficient of the <span class=\"math\">[MATH: k]</span>th-degree term is</p>",
            "readable_text": "In particular, the coefficient of the [MATH: k]th-degree term is",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\dfrac{f^{(k)}(a)}{k!}.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "[MATH: \\dfrac{f^{(k)}(a)}{k!}.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Content:\nThe [MATH: n]th-degree Taylor polynomial of a function [MATH: f(x)] around the point [MATH: x=a] is\n\nContent:\n[MATH: P_n(x) = f(a) + f'(a)(x-a) + \\dfrac{f''(a)}{2!}(x-a)^2 + \\cdots + \\dfrac{f^{(n)}(a)}{n!}(x-a)^n.]\n\nContent:\nIn particular, the coefficient of the [MATH: k]th-degree term is\n\nContent:\n[MATH: \\dfrac{f^{(k)}(a)}{k!}.]"
      },
